{"id":"n15765-1-7","stage":1,"title":"수저 · 勺筷","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15765-1-7-1","ko":"어른이 수저를 드시기 전에 너희들이 먼저 밥을 먹으면 어떡하니?","zh":"大人在拿筷子之前，如果你们先吃饭的话怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어른이","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"4","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수저를","meaning":"勺筷","explanation":"수저：勺筷；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수저","audio":"/audio/88402f3d5059d2b1eee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15765","senseId":"1","lemma":"수저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드시기","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너희들이","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭","explanation":"밥：饭；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"1","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：